  "details": "It only happens with certain avatars (the oldest one, at the time of Physbone implementation, and the newest one, re-uploaded with the latest SDK).\n\nI don't know the conditions under which it occurs, but all FX layers are frozen.\n\nAnimations in progress are stuck in the middle of the animation, and in that state, all animations in the FX layer do not work.\n\nAlso, this phenomenon does not occur when running in desktop mode, but only when running in VR mode.\n\nIt was working fine until about a month ago, but this phenomenon has been occurring since the timing of the recent VRChat update.",
